# Headstone Pilgrimage: the other NM of each pair killed first, no fragment held. Behemoth's Dominion: 200's
# option 1 shows AIR_AROUND_YOU_CHANGED (7339) and spawns both weapons; right after the Legendary Weapon's kill
# the headstone says SOMETHING_BETTER (7340). Yuhtunga Jungle: 200's option 1 shows THE_OPO_OPOS_ATTACK (7721)
# and spawns both Opo-opos; right after Carthi's kill, SOMETHING_BETTER (7698). The trace cannot show whether
# a killed NM still counts as spawned there (the two spawn tests joined by or change no trace), so the one-up
# arm is pinned by a fake check.
# The two kills give 150 and 145 XP. The Yuhtunga zone-in writes Mission[10][6]diggingZone 114
# (Yuhtunga's Zone.lua: A Moogle Kupo d'Etat's digging helper).
lists BehemothsDominion/Cermet_Headstone/onTrigger BehemothsDominion/onEventFinish/200 BehemothsDominion/onEventFinish/201
lists YuhtungaJungle/Cermet_Headstone/onTrigger YuhtungaJungle/onEventFinish/200 YuhtungaJungle/onEventFinish/201
char zone=BehemothsDominion pos=-72,-5,-88 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart HeadstonePilgrimage current
login
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # 200
finish option=1                         # AIR_AROUND_YOU_CHANGED, both weapons spawned
kill LEGENDARY_WEAPON
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # after the kill: SOMETHING_BETTER
warp 491,20,301 YuhtungaJungle
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # 200
finish option=1                         # THE_OPO_OPOS_ATTACK, both Opo-opos spawned
kill CARTHI
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # after the kill: SOMETHING_BETTER
